              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "The dependent requires actual supervised titration with handling, addition and documentation. Correct eye protection, clear labelled workspace and stopping for an unclear vessel or splash are necessary parts of that safe practical performance; paper calculation alone cannot stand for the dependent's whole performance."
            }
          ],
          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The alternative original operation is determining acid/base concentration by titration, not merely describing an indicator. Actually carrying out this measurement necessarily needs basic safe workspace, eye protection and stopping/reporting on an unclear vessel or splash.",
