              "reviewGroupId": "goal-1dc15fa2-fca4-56b0-b5c1-4d215613dde0-required-by-02634fdd-c8ba-591a-b240-77129b1bebb8",
              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "The titration profile requires independently developing analytical amount/volume references, distinguishing aliquot amounts from concentration, and deriving 1:1 versus 1:2 stoichiometry. Meaningful use of mol for named entities and constituent ratios is necessary to do this rather than only substitute numbers."
            }
          ],
          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "Both original course rows require performing titration and evaluating its results including errors. Quantitative concentration determination requires the meaning of named analytical amounts in mol and stoichiometric entity ratios; this is not supplied by just knowing an indicator colour.",
