          ],
          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original common-column operation explicitly joins acid/base titration with concentration calculation and lists amounts/concentrations. A meaningful aliquot/stoichiometry calculation needs the mol/entity competence. The chosen alternative avoids using LK-only titration curves as universal support.",
