          "thisPhysicalEdgeDecision": "approve",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "The dependent interprets a condition-specific molar gas volume and compares different ideal gases and changed pressure. The Avogadro relation between equal V at equal T,p and equal particle amount is necessary to justify that common molar-volume model and its limits.",
          "routeNecessityReview": [
            {
              "prerequisiteGoalId": "1e5a4b89-69f1-5379-811e-c8ec76faad2a",
