          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original explicitly includes molar-volume calculations with correct physical quantities/units. Justifying a common ideal-gas Vm under fixed T,p requires the equal-volume/equal-particle-amount relation and its condition boundary. It supports acquisition, not a claim that the official row explicitly names Avogadro.",
