              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "The protection tasks require explaining passive barriers, damaged metal coatings, galvanic electron/ion paths and sacrificial-anode consumption. Local-element and sacrificial-anode mechanisms of the prerequisite are necessary to evaluate those protection options and their failure conditions."
            }
          ],
          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The actual source explicitly applies galvanic knowledge to local elements, explains sacrificial-anode protection and conducts protection experiments. These operations require the prior local-corrosion, protection and sacrificial-anode competence. The selected oxygen/acid distinction alone would have been too narrow; the direct protection alternatives supply the needed operation.",
