          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "The dependent uses the same NaCl melt and CuCl2 solution processes and requires ion migration, balanced electrode equations, product ratio and forced operation. The complete simple-salt electrolysis explanation is necessary; galvanic comparison adds a further operation.",
          "routeNecessityReview": [
            {
              "prerequisiteGoalId": "70b12d1c-abaf-45c6-ae9e-b571e9cbc126",
              "dependentGoalId": "fd7977bf-1d8e-5c5e-9c37-bd76bb2ffeef",
              "groupIndex": 42,
