              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "The dependent uses the same NaCl melt and CuCl2 solution processes and requires ion migration, balanced electrode equations, product ratio and forced operation. The complete simple-salt electrolysis explanation is necessary; galvanic comparison adds a further operation."
            }
          ],
          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original electrolysis-principle explanation and comparison with a galvanic cell require forced ionic/electrode processes and energy direction, not just an apparatus sketch. The simple-salt process competence is necessary to the current whole explanation and its stated aqueous/melt boundary.",
