          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original common operation explicitly explains electrolysis as forced redox for producing substances. Ion migration and coupled metal/nonmetal electrode processes are necessary to a material-level explanation of that process; the current dependent adds product ratios and the galvanic comparison.",
